  "ruleText": "Per 102.53 “Level” means a number indicating placement within the hierarchy of a job series reflecting the increasing complexity, job responsibility, and minimum qualifications within the job series.\n\nSource. #13667, eff 6-22-23; renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.46), eff 12-1-25",
